+**Access:** Anonymous.
+
+**Body:** `application/json` → `ConfirmEmailRequestDto`; `text/json` → `ConfirmEmailRequestDto`; `application/*+json` → `ConfirmEmailRequestDto`.
+
+**Success:** 204 (no body).
+
